      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a grad student working on a sociology curriculum for high schoolers. can u help me put together a teaching guide that explains how systemic racism actually operates in housing and banking? like, i need a breakdown of the specific ways these systems keep inequality going so i can teach the kids. thanks!",
